<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Jenkins</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --indigo: #1e1b4b;
      --violet: #7c3aed;
      --pink: #ec4899;
      --coral: #ff5a5f;
      --amber: #ffb020;
      --teal: #14b8a6;
      --sky: #38bdf8;
      --ink: #1f2240;
      --muted: #5d6185;
      --soft: #f5f3ff;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--white);
      font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Hero band with navigation */
    .top {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: var(--white);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.55), transparent 45%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 90%, rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.35), transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #4c1d95 60%, #7c3aed 100%);
    }

    nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 76px; }
    .brand { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral), var(--amber));
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-weight: 800; color: var(--indigo);
    }
    nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 32px; }
    nav ul a { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); font-weight: 500; }
    nav ul a:hover { color: var(--amber); }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 72px 0 104px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .lead { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #ddd6fe; max-width: 46ch; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--amber); color: var(--indigo); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #ffc24d; }
    .btn-ghost { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55); color: var(--white); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }

    /* Pipeline panel */
    .panel {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(10, 8, 40, 0.45);
    }
    .panel-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .panel-head strong { font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .badge {
      background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d;
      font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .progress { height: 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #ece9fe; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .progress span {
      display: block; height: 100%; width: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--sky), var(--violet), var(--amber), var(--teal));
      animation: fill 3.4s ease-out 0.4s forwards;
    }
    @keyframes fill { to { width: 100%; } }

    .stages { list-style: none; }
    .stages li {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeaff;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .stages li:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 4px; }
    .stages li small { margin-left: auto; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .dot {
      flex: none;
      width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e7e4f7;
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      color: var(--white); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 800;
      animation: lit 0.4s forwards;
    }
    .dot::after { content: "\2713"; opacity: 0; animation: tick 0.4s forwards; }
    .s1 .dot { --c: var(--sky); }
    .s2 .dot { --c: var(--violet); }
    .s3 .dot { --c: var(--amber); }
    .s4 .dot { --c: var(--teal); }
    .s1 .dot, .s1 .dot::after { animation-delay: 0.7s; }
    .s2 .dot, .s2 .dot::after { animation-delay: 1.5s; }
    .s3 .dot, .s3 .dot::after { animation-delay: 2.3s; }
    .s4 .dot, .s4 .dot::after { animation-delay: 3.1s; }
    @keyframes lit { to { background: var(--c); } }
    @keyframes tick { to { opacity: 1; } }

    /* Features */
    .features { background: var(--soft); }
    .features .wrap { padding-top: 88px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      max-width: 20ch;
      color: var(--indigo);
    }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; }
    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px 28px 36px;
      border-top: 6px solid var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.08);
    }
    .card:nth-child(1) { --accent: var(--teal); --tint: #ccfbf1; }
    .card:nth-child(2) { --accent: var(--violet); --tint: #ede9fe; }
    .card:nth-child(3) { --accent: var(--coral); --tint: #ffe4e4; }
    .icon {
      width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--tint);
      display: grid; place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); }

    /* Call to action */
    .cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--coral), var(--pink) 55%, var(--violet));
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }
    .cta h2 { color: var(--white); margin: 0 auto 16px; max-width: 24ch; }
    .cta p { color: #ffe4f1; margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .cta .btn-primary { background: var(--white); color: var(--indigo); }
    .cta .btn-primary:hover { background: #fff3d6; }

    footer { background: var(--indigo); color: #c4bff0; padding: 36px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 48px 0 72px; gap: 48px; }
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      nav ul { display: none; }
      .stages li small { display: none; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .progress span { animation-duration: 0.01s; animation-delay: 0s; }
      .dot, .dot::after { animation-duration: 0.01s; animation-delay: 0s !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top" id="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <a href="#top" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">J</span>Jenkins CI/CD</a>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#top">Pipeline</a></li>
          <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <section class="hero">
        <div>
          <h1>Welcome to Jenkins</h1>
          <p class="lead">This site was built, tested, and deployed automatically. Push your code and the pipeline does the rest.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-primary">See how it works</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Get in touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" aria-label="Example pipeline run">
          <div class="panel-head">
            <strong>Build #42</strong>
            <span class="badge">Passing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress"><span></span></div>
          <ol class="stages">
            <li class="s1"><span class="dot"></span>Commit <small>Code pushed to GitHub</small></li>
            <li class="s2"><span class="dot"></span>Build <small>Application packaged</small></li>
            <li class="s3"><span class="dot"></span>Test <small>All checks passed</small></li>
            <li class="s4"><span class="dot"></span>Deploy <small>Live on EC2</small></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ship changes without touching the server</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">&#9881;&#65039;</div>
          <h3>Automated builds</h3>
          <p>Every push to the repository starts a fresh build, so the code on the server always matches the code in Git.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">&#129514;</div>
          <h3>Continuous testing</h3>
          <p>Tests run before anything goes live. If a check fails, the deployment stops and the current site stays up.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">&#128640;</div>
          <h3>Hands-free deployment</h3>
          <p>Jenkins copies the finished files to the app server for you. No manual uploads and no logging in over SSH.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="contact">
    <h2>Ready to automate your next release?</h2>
    <p>Commit a change and watch it go live.</p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@example.com" class="btn btn-primary">Contact us</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <span>Deployed with Jenkins on AWS EC2.</span>
      <span>hello@example.com</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
